DefaultRangeCut 0.005
Region Spacecraft
Spacecraft.Volume SCbody
Spacecraft.RangeCut 1.

Region Pipebody
Pipebody.Volume PIPbody
Pipebody.RangeCut 1.

# Source
DataChallenge.Source               bn090424592
bn090424592.ParticleType    1
bn090424592.Beam            FarFieldPointSource 0.0 0.0

